    "perplexity": {
      "description": "Rejuvenation 2001-2014 is a Simple Minds box set that brings together the band’s 21st-century studio output in one package, issued by Demon Records as a 6-LP coloured vinyl set and also as a 7CD+DVD book edition. It collects the albums Neon Lights (2001), Cry (2002), Black & White 050505 (2005), Graffiti Soul (2009), and Big Music (2014), presenting a substantial overview of the band’s modern-era revival.\n\nMusically, the set traces Simple Minds’ blend of rock and pop across a period when the group refined a more streamlined, atmospheric sound while still drawing on the melodic sweep and drive that defined their earlier work. The contents also include bonus material on the expanded edition, making it useful both as a career-spanning survey and as a deeper archive of the era’s non-album tracks and alternates.",
